.TH clyde 1 "" "clyde 1.0.2" "clyde Manual"
.SH NAME
clyde \- local repository bundle review and NotebookLM sync harness
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B clyde
.RI [ command ]
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
clyde prepares reviewable local repository bundles and uploads them to NotebookLM only after explicit approval.
Run
.BR clyde\ doctor ,
then
.BR clyde\ preview ,
then
.BR clyde\ bundle ,
then
.BR clyde\ sync\ --dry-run
before approving an upload.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B about
Show clyde product details and official links.
.br
.B Usage
.nf
clyde \-\-about
clyde about
.fi
.TP
.B help
Show human\-readable help or a JSON command catalog.
.br
.B Usage
.nf
clyde help [\-\-json|COMMAND]
.fi
.TP
.B completion
Generate shell completion for Bash, Zsh, Fish, PowerShell, Elvish, Nushell, Xonsh, Tcsh, Clink, Yash, or Oil.
.br
.B Usage
.nf
clyde completion {bash|zsh|fish|powershell|pwsh|elvish|nushell|nu|xonsh|tcsh|clink|yash|oil|osh|ysh}
.fi
.TP
.B doctor
Check clyde configuration, platform, PATH tools, Ollama, and optional repo scan readiness.
.br
.B Usage
.nf
clyde doctor [REPO] [\-\-json] [\-\-ollama\-timeout SECONDS]
.fi
.TP
.B tui
Open clyde's dependency\-free terminal UI.
.br
.B Usage
.nf
clyde tui
.fi
.TP
.B config
Show, initialize, or print the clyde configuration path.
.br
.B Usage
.nf
