.fi
.TP
.B gcf
Convert JSON and GCF locally, or compare GCF size against compact JSON.
.br
.B Usage
.nf
clyde gcf {encode|decode|stats} [FILE|\-] [\-\-json (stats only)]
.fi
.TP
.B preview
Report included and skipped repository files before bundling or upload. Git repositories fail closed if Git\-aware discovery fails unless \-\-allow\-filesystem\-fallback is explicit.
.br
.B Usage
.nf
clyde preview REPO [scan flags] [\-\-format text|json|gcf|auto] [\-\-json|\-\-gcf]
.fi
.TP
.B scan\-report
Summarize repository scan shape with largest files, extensions, skip reasons, chunk counts, and discovery method.
.br
.B Usage
.nf
clyde scan\-report REPO [scan flags] [\-\-format text|json|gcf|auto] [\-\-json|\-\-gcf] [\-\-top N]
.fi
.TP
.B bundle
Write a digest\-bound local manifest and source chunks for review. Secret\-scan commands run against clyde's captured source snapshot.
.br
.B Usage
.nf
clyde bundle REPO \-\-out DIR [scan flags] [\-\-force] [\-\-secret\-scan\-command CMD] [\-\-require\-secret\-scan]
.fi
.TP
.B sync
Upload a verified bundle, or less\-auditable live scan chunks, to NotebookLM after explicit approval.
.br
.B Usage
.nf
clyde sync \-\-bundle DIR \-\-approve\-digest sha256:... \-\-notebook\-id ID \-\-approve\-upload [\-\-receipt PATH] [\-\-resume] [\-\-heartbeat\-interval SECONDS]
clyde sync REPO \-\-notebook\-id ID \-\-approve\-upload [\-\-receipt PATH] [\-\-heartbeat\-interval SECONDS]
.fi
.TP
.B receipt
Show the state and recovery guidance for a sync receipt.
.br
.B Usage
.nf
